# INERT for this project. `wrangler pages deploy` (Cloudflare Pages) does NOT read .assetsignore
# or .gitignore; .assetsignore is a Workers static-assets mechanism. The rules below do not
# filter the live site (tracked *.py, *.mjs, /*.md and .github/** are served). Kept only in case
# the project ever moves to Workers assets; do NOT rely on it to hide anything.
# Real boundary: the git-tracked set uploaded by the clean-checkout GitHub Actions deploy
# (.github/workflows/deploy.yml), and the GitHub repo itself is PUBLIC, so tracked == public in
# both places. See docs/COVERAGE-AND-DISCLOSURE-POLICY.md "How privacy is enforced";
# verify a deploy with `python check_live_boundary.py`.
.github
repo-workflows
*.py
*.mjs
/*.md
.gitignore
.assetsignore
_*
